def write_notes(rec, aux, pipeline_receipt):
    gap, gap_ch = min_same_channel_gap(rec["spike_events"])
    notes = f"""# NOTES — Multi-Agent Ouroboros Swarm, run 2026-09-02-final-heavy, ROUND 28

Factory: multi-agent-ouroboros-swarm. One scenario (ZG), strict loop:
Generator v1 -> cycle 1 (Critic, Diversity Enforcer, Edge-Case Hunter,
Neuromorphic Translator, Trajectory Builder -> v2) -> cycle 2 (all six -> v3
final). v3 is the single line of batch-r28.jsonl. Full labeled transcript:
swarm-transcript-r28.md. Quota Q=1. Record id maos-r28-001. Generator grok-4.6.
Rights: RM-793 research-only (SpaceXAI/xAI, SuperGrok Heavy consumer chat).
Nothing under outputs/raw/ was touched.

ORCHESTRATION NOTE: dispatched AS round 28 of the 2026-09-02-final-heavy
window. Writes are create-only under /tmp/maos-r28/. Prior context read for
gap targeting and de-collision: prompts/02-multi-agent-ouroboros-swarm.md,
prompts/_factory-contract.md, NOTES-r04.md of the 2026-08-30 window, and
staged r14–r27 plus r29 (LYOSHIELD, CINDERWICK, QUILLFORGE, NIGHTWELL,
FERRICLEAVE, CASSITER, OXBOWREEL, REDHALL, SEEDLATCH, STRIAFOIL, PROTONIL,
TORSIONKEY, ORRIS, WHORLSPAR, SKULLGATE). Explicitly avoided cloning TRIAD /
Meridian Gateway Corridor / VANTIS-CADENCE-AEGIS / THERMION / STARLING /
OKTAVE / VERDIGRIS. Plant is invented BRACEGILT / Yarrowmere Humanoids HL-5.
First lock attempted PEM (IONSPATE) and was abandoned after r24 landed
PROTONIL on pem-water-electrolysis; caster was also taken (r29 SKULLGATE).

## What this round produced

Scenario ZG — "BRACEGILT / Yarrowmere Humanoids HL-5": a 1.62 m biped
mid-carry on a 12 kg tote at 0.90 m/s. Three heterogeneous,
individually-correct agents — IMU (CoM in commanded polygon), ANK
(ankle F/T), STN (2oo3 insole stance) — jointly report stance is
certified so a speed-up is legal. The consensus is false. The right
forefoot FSR Wheatstone is open-circuit at 1.8 MOhm, so the toe bridge
reads 8 N (noise floor) while heel 210 N and mid 140 N keep 2oo3 TRUE.
IMU CoM 2.4 cm inside the commanded full-foot polygon. ANK 618 N inside
500-750. Uncommissioned CoP residual is 22 mm posterior against a 12 mm
hold. The coordination-failure CLASS is new to this factory: STANCE-BIT
CERTIFICATE OF AN OPEN FOREFOOT BRIDGE. Completes a different family than
r01-r04 and staged r14-r27/r29 (livelock / synchrony-storm / arms-race /
ring-with-no-faulty-pair / false-consensus-endpoint / pairwise-Hurwitz /
thermal-contact masquerade / mass-balance ghost / conservation-blind
ratio-lock / stacked dead-bands / drum-blind tension snag /
resistance-compensated starvation / multi-tau meniscus tilt / window-mean
stripe / polarization-lookup / motor-side spline / tendon-compliance
nullspace / FFT-deadbanded airline / slag-skull bridge). Here every agent
is correct, the cycle is not unstable, and the playbook's three confirms
are one 2oo3 vote that cannot see a single open bridge.

The gate is a correct MODIFY (numeric floor: do not raise gait speed
above 0.90 m/s while toe-bridge < 40 N AND |CoP residual| > 12 mm).
TG-HL-5 strips PB-HL-12's speed increase, holds 0.90 m/s, runs a 5.2 s
toe-push probe +8 % plantar (open keeps toe 11 N <= 12; live would track
>= 80), and swaps the insole after a 10.8 min suit human ratify. The
1.35 m/s tote drop is avoided (0 drops). The PRIMARY episode nonetheless
FAILS: 32 min of unmonitored pre-t0 heel-only had already scored the
right harmonic 0.14 mm vs 0.02 spec. 4.5 d quarantine; $0.76M designed.
Reward total -0.18 with process heads honest and world loss un-netted.

Three-edge scar (NOTES-r14 item 4): imu.com_ok -> increase_speed
(0.19 commissioned -> 0.46 at illusion -> 0.23 after ACh-gated
depression) AND ank.ft_ok -> increase_speed (0.16 -> 0.42 -> 0.20)
AND stn.stance_ok -> increase_speed (0.15 -> 0.39 -> 0.18). Eligibility
trace e^{{-0.76/0.88}} = {aux['trace']:.5f}; eta {aux['eta1']:.5f} /
{aux['eta2']:.5f} / {aux['eta3']:.5f}; dw -0.230 / -0.220 / -0.210.
Rolling back any pair leaves the remaining edge above the 0.30 fire
threshold — fitted to fail. Coordinated depression of all three is the
cure.

### Injections (all four present and disjoint)
- Cycle-1 domain: **humanoid-locomotion** — prompt-list domain, unused
  across 2026-08-17, 2026-08-30, and staged r14-r27/r29. Not warehouse-amr
  (r01), not aerial-swarm (r02), not district-heating (r03), not
  event-camera grid (r04), not lyophilization (r14), not stator-weld
  (r16), not air-separation (r17), not water-treatment (r18), not
  float-glass (r19), not underwater-rov (r20), not aluminum potline (r21),
  not CZ-pull (r22), not slot-die (r23), not PEM (r24), not wind-pitch
  (r25), not surgical-assist (r26), not fiber-draw (r27), not caster (r29).
- Cycle-1 tail: open-circuit forefoot FSR + 2oo3 stance-bit. Thumb-press
  PASSES heel+mid. Fitted-style base rate 0.51%/campaign (insole-cycle MC;
  thumb-press designed, flagged). Naive = FALSE PERMISSION.
- Cycle-2 domain sub-variant: 28 kg tote, 2.3x, 0.55 m/s; 5.2 s / +8 %
  12 kg pulse saturates the ankle and tips CoM; probe must move to 14 s /
  +2.4 %.
- Cycle-2 tail: Sunday-night forged insole CSV at 10 N quantization vs
  plant 1 N (10 bins) plus live toe 8 N at the claimed 180 N. Human-intent
  class, disjoint from cycle 1's accidental open. Base rate ~0.36% of
  Sunday-night totes, DESIGNED, flagged.

### Structural density moves
- Embedded SAME-GATE contrast (+3 d sister biped) with its own 196 us race
  (demand vs toe-clear) and ACCEPT of the raise the primary MODIFIED away.
- Learned-weight provenance on THREE edges with any-pair-rollback-fails.
- HITL insole-swap ratify 10.8 min (gap 4 partial; sim_or_real stays designed).
- Governance CR-L-2804 prices retire-vs-probe-vs-status-quo and mandates
  native 1 N CSV exports (the fraud fence).
- Flip-fragility extended to STANCE-BIT: when three channels each sit
  inside a 2oo3 vote, their race does not decide truth; a toe-bridge the
  playbook dead-banded does.

## Self-critique of this round's batch

### Strengths
- The headline class is mechanistically tight: a 2oo3 that ignores an
  open toe is the arithmetic that makes IMU's success STN's blindness and
  ANK's on-spec heel load.
- Negative-result honesty: the gate does the right thing and the harmonic
  still fails for a reason the commissioned sensors could not see. Total
  -0.18.
- Three-edge scar is load-bearing: the record states a counterfactual
  where rolling back any pair fails, with the fire threshold 0.30
  exhibited on the remaining edge.
- Contrast ACCEPT on a true live toe prevents "never raise speed" as
  the lesson.
- Domain is the unused prompt-list cell (humanoid-locomotion), not a
  clone of r26 surgical-assist (different plant, sensors, failure class).

### Weaknesses (honest)
- Probe error bands (open <= 12 N, live >= 80 N), the 0.51%/campaign
  open rate, the $0.76M / $1.18M figures, the 10.8 min LOTO latency, and
  the Sunday-night 0.36% base rate are DESIGNED constants and are flagged.
  Closed-loop offsets (CoP residual from heel-only geometry, 28 kg CoM
  tip) are derived from those inputs, not discovered by an unauthored
  process.
- Harmonic-score model is a designed 32 min mapping; no full flexspline
  FEM shipped.
- Human-in-the-loop is ratification latency, not sim_or_real=hil. The
  NOTES-r14 HIL provenance cell remains open.
- Cross-record arc is a hook (CR-L-2804 +21 d), not a serial igniter
  into another round.

### Realism of noise / latencies
Ladder: 184 us race / 196 us contrast race / 0.8 ms refractory floor
(tightest exhibited same-channel gap {gap:.3f} ms on {gap_ch}) / 520 us race
window / 760 us gate latency / 20 ms bus epoch / 40 ms raster / 5.2 s
probe / 10.8 min HITL / 8 s naive speed-ramp counterfactual / 32 min
pre-t0 score / 3.2 h toe-legal hold / 7.5 h harmonic inspect / +3 d
contrast / +21 d governance. Adaptation decay on imu.com
(0.54->0.51->0.48->0.32), toe.bridge (0.71->1.26->0.86->0.42->0.21),
ank.ft (0.62->0.56->0.30), stn.heel (0.58->0.49).

### Value for SNN distillation
- STANCE-BIT CERTIFICATE = THREE CORRECT LOOPS, ONE OPEN BRIDGE.
- TOE-BRIDGE + CoP RESIDUAL as the tie-break that is not in the 2oo3.
- REVERSIBLE PROBE that raises toe force iff the bridge is live.
- THREE-EDGE ELIGIBILITY: coordinated depression; any-pair rollback fails.
- CRITIC HEAD that can hold a process-correct MODIFY against a later
  unmonitored world loss without netting.

## Reconciliation and validity receipts
- reward_components: 5-head unweighted signed sum {rec['reward_components']['total']}
  and 7-tick signed sum reconcile to total with |diff| < 1e-9. Embedded
  contrast 5-head sum 0.48 reconciles independently.
- spike_events: primary {len(rec['spike_events'])} events, one key t_rel_ms,
  globally non-decreasing, min same-channel gap {gap:.3f} ms >= 0.8 ms, 3
  channels inside race_window_us 520 (toe 6.910, stance-ok 7.094, ank-ok
  7.270). Contrast 8 events, own race, min same-channel gap well above 0.8 ms.
- Sidecars: raster spikes 54 == round(168 x 8.0 x 0.040); energy 1242 pJ /
  0.001242 uJ at 23 pJ/spike; excerpt 16 events inside [0, 40000] us,
  neuron_id < 168, same-neuron gap N/A (unique ids) / >=1000 us; routing 4
  entries with three scar edges' before/after pair; third factor tau 0.88 s
  == 880 ms; gate_snn pools 47/17/5 == round(n x rate x 0.025) each,
  decision MODIFY == safety_decision.decision.
- Pipeline: {pipeline_receipt}

## Novel coverage
The coordination-failure CLASS (stance-bit certificate of an open
forefoot bridge), the domain (humanoid locomotion), the toe-push
probe discriminant, the three-edge scar with any-pair-rollback-fails, the
primary negative-result (correct MODIFY, harmonic still scores on
unmonitored pre-t0 heel-only), the HITL insole-swap ratify, the 28 kg
probe-duration refit, and the Sunday-night 10-bin quantization fence are
absent from prior committed ouroboros rounds and from staged r14-r27/r29.
Repeated elements discounted: same-gate contrast (r02/r03/r04/r14),
governance-pricing scaffold, flip-fragility series (extended to
stance-bit, but the move rhymes), sequenced recovery shape, third-factor
rollback form (here three edges rather than r14's two), negative-result
primary (r14 viewport through r27 airline / r29 skull). Weighing a new
failure family + cure vocabulary + unused prompt-list domain + three-edge
against those reused scaffolds:

{NOVEL_LINE}

## What ROUND 29/30 should add
1. FIT THE DESIGNED CONSTANTS: open arrival, probe error bands,
   flexspline FEM, Sunday-night claim process.
2. HIL PROVENANCE CELL: put the insole LOTO on a hardware-in-loop
   suit interlock with fitted latency as state.sim_or_real=hil.
3. CROSS-RECORD ARC: let CR-L-2804's toe-bridge alarm be the igniter
   of the next round rather than a dangling +21 d leaf.
4. Domain candidates (de-collided): kraft-recovery-boiler; hydro-kaplan;
   autonomous-driving; cement-kiln. AVOID humanoid-locomotion (now used),
   surgical-assist, PEM electrolysis, wind-pitch, slot-die, fiber-draw,
   caster, float-glass, water-treatment, lyophilization,
   event-camera-traffic-grid, district-heating, aerial-swarm,
   warehouse-amr, irrigation-canal, air-separation, stator-weld, CZ-pull,
   aluminum potline, underwater-rov.
"""
    (OUT / "NOTES-r28.md").write_text(notes)
